          "title": "Original grain; editable native response",
          "text": "R is the original quantized grain height BEFORE normals, AO and roughness. G is its original 4px FFT neighbourhood. Native nodes differentiate height and recompute cavity/roughness. Registered source fields preserve Poisson seams, percentile range and original FFT scales. No finished normal/AO/roughness is imported. No half buffer after field decoding.",
